<title>NETHERLANDS: BLYDENSTEIN 1996 NET LOSS WIDENS.</title>
<headline>BLYDENSTEIN 1996 NET LOSS WIDENS.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss per share (guilders)    1.76 vs   0.56</p>
<p>    Net loss				 2.9  vs   0.9</p>
<p>    Turnover			     113.3  vs 103.6</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     0.7  vs   0.2</p>
<p>    Interest charges		     1.6  vs   1.5</p>
<p>    Tax gain				 0.2  vs   0.7</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary charge	   2.1  vs   0.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Textiles firm Blydenstein-Willink NV said in August</p>
<p>it expected a loss for the whole of 1996.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
